# Fixture: with_named_graph.trig
#
# Purpose: a TriG file declaring two named graphs. v1 supports only the default
# graph; canonicalize() must raise CanonicalizationError on any input with
# named-graph contexts. Exit code 4 at the CLI surface.

@prefix : <http://example.org/quads#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

<http://example.org/quads> a owl:Ontology .

:G1 {
    :A a owl:Class .
}

:G2 {
    :B a owl:Class .
}
